      "B) 11",
      "C) 14",
      "D) 13",
      "E) 12"
    ],
    "correctIndex": 4,
    "correctAnswer": "E",
    "solution": "💡 ALTIN FORMÜL / KURAL:\nTaraf tarafa çarpma: (a · b · c)² = 12 · 20 · 15 = 3600.\n\n🪜 ADIM ADIM ÇÖZÜM:\n1. a · b · c = √3600 = 60\n2. Değişkenleri bulalım:\n• c = 60 / (a · b) = 60 / 12 = 5\n• a = 60 / (b · c) = 60 / 20 = 3\n• b = 60 / (a · c) = 60 / 15 = 4\n3. Toplam = a + b + c = 3 + 4 + 5 = 12 bulunur.",
    "sourceQuestionImages": [],
