    "solution": "💡 ALTIN FORMÜL / KURAL:\n• 0,x̄ = x/9\n• 0,xȳ = (10x + y - x) / 90 = (9x + y) / 90\n\n🪜 ADIM ADIM ÇÖZÜM:\n1. Pay = x/9 + y/9 = (x + y) / 9\n2. Payda:\n(9x + y) / 90 + (9y + x) / 90 = (10x + 10y) / 90 = 10(x + y) / 90 = (x + y) / 9\n3. Oran:\n[(x + y) / 9] / [(x + y) / 9] = 1 bulunur.",
    "sourceQuestionImages": [],
