    "difficulty": "zor",
    "question": "E evrensel kümesinde A ve B iki alt kümedir.\ns((A ∪ B)') = 4\ns(A \\ B) = 7\ns(B \\ A) = 11\ns(E) = 28\nolduğuna göre, s(A ∩ B) kaçtır?",
    "options": [
      "A) 4",
      "B) 5",
      "C) 6",
      "D) 7",
      "E) 8"
    ],
    "correctIndex": 2,
    "correctAnswer": "C",
    "solution": "💡 ALTIN FORMÜL / KURAL:\nEvrensel Küme = s(A \\ B) + s(A ∩ B) + s(B \\ A) + s((A ∪ B)').\n\n🪜 ADIM ADIM ÇÖZÜM:\n1. 28 = 7 + s(A ∩ B) + 11 + 4\n2. 28 = 22 + s(A ∩ B)\n3. s(A ∩ B) = 28 - 22 = 6 bulunur.",
    "sourceQuestionImages": [],
    "sourceSolutionImages": []
